      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 650,
        "height": 591,
        "content": "# Setup guide\n\n1. Import the workflow JSON into n8n.\n2. Open every node with a warning icon and select the required credential.\n3. Replace placeholder IDs, URLs, recipients, channel IDs, table/sheet names, and thresholds.\n4. Run a manual test using a non-production record.\n5. Confirm each branch, storage write, and notification before activation.\n\n## Credential map\n- **Receive Payer Denial Notice** → swapnilailabs@gmail.com\n- **Denial Extraction Model** → OpenAI account\n- **Notify Billing Manager - Non-Appealable** → swapnilailabs@gmail.com\n- **Appeal Drafting Model** → OpenAI account\n- **Save Appeal Packet to Drive** → Google Drive account\n- **Notify Front Desk of Drafted Appeal** → swapnilailabs@gmail.com\n\nEstimated setup time: 20–40 minutes."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
